meta {
  name: Get My Wishlist
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/wishlist
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~page: 0
  ~size: 20
  ~sort: createdAt,desc
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get My Wishlist

  Returns the authenticated user's wishlist, paginated.

  ## Authentication

  Requires a valid JWT token in the `Authorization: Bearer` header.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Default | Description |
  |-----------|---------|-------------|
  | page | 0 | Page number (0-based) |
  | size | 20 | Number of items per page (max 100) |
  | sort | createdAt,desc | Sort field and direction |

  ## Sort Options

  - `createdAt,desc`: Most recently added first
  - `createdAt,asc`: Oldest first
  - `title,asc`: By game title A-Z

  ## Response (200 OK)

  ```json
  {
    "content": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "videoGameId": "uuid",
        "title": "Game Title",
        "coverUrl": "https://...",
        "releaseDate": "2025-01-15",
        "addedAt": "2025-06-01T10:00:00"
      }
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "page": 0,
      "size": 20,
      "totalElements": 5,
      "totalPages": 1,
      "first": true,
      "last": true,
      "hasNext": false,
      "hasPrevious": false
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Error Responses

  - **401 Unauthorized**: Not authenticated
}
